title: The Trapped Aisle
portrait left: seeker

You notice a relic sitting on the ground, between two dangerous looking shelves.

choice:
  - Dash ahead to grab the relic (take 12 damage, take the relic) -> dash
  - Try and sneak to the relic (a coin flip) -> sneak
  - Go around -> leave

@dash
  > hp -12
  > relic random uncommon
  You trip over a stone and tumble into a shelf- scraping your arm. But you get the relic.
  > end

@sneak
  > flag set sneak-roll
  You approach the relic, and look down to be sure you step carefully. When you look up the relic is gone.
  > gold 20
  > end

@leave
  You decide the relic probably isn't worth the trouble.
  > end
